Rootstock Blue includes optional integration surfaces for independently
distributed projects, including Santa, Velociraptor, UAC,
macos-UnifiedLogs, Fleet, osquery, Atomic Red Team, Sigma, and Elastic
detection content. Those projects are not bundled by the Rootstock Blue Swift
package unless a source file states otherwise. Review the upstream license
before adding or redistributing third-party code or content.
